## sanidhyy/duolingo-clone ("Lingo")

Copyright (c) 2024 Sanidhya Kumar Verma — MIT License
https://github.com/sanidhyy/duolingo-clone

The learning interface in `ui/` is derived from that project: the button and
progress primitives, the lesson card / challenge / footer / header /
question-bubble / result-card components, and the snaking lesson-path button
geometry. The vendor stack around them (Next.js, Clerk, Stripe, Neon, Drizzle,
react-admin) was removed; the components now talk to this project's Python and
SQLite mastery engine instead.

Bundled assets under `ui/public/assets/` also come from that repository, which
in turn credits:

- Kenney Assets — https://kenney.nl/
- Freesound — https://freesound.org/
- ElevenLabs — https://elevenlabs.io/

